(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-62","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["旧博物馆馆员笑称自己是旧纸的[[addict|痴迷者]]，却不能随意[[withhold|扣住]]任何捐赠。院里正办基金[[banquet|宴席]]，大家被新展的[[thrill|兴奋]]带来，站长要[[convene|召集]]馆员签[[supplementary|补充的]]清单。纸袋上一道蓝[[streak|条痕]]，明显[[originate|来自]]旧箱。捐款的[[millionaire|百万富翁]]只问[[transit|运输]]是否及时，旁边做义工的[[adolescent|青少年]]忙着收盘。[[nonetheless|尽管如此]]馆员愿意带我们看旧柜，因为她也想知道自己的签名为何到了另一个库房的单上。","她把展品与样品的[[differentiation|区别]]写在封套边，药史展里关于[[cocaine|可卡因]]的旧文字本属复制讲解，不代表实物。货架每道[[groove|槽]]有固定编号，清单里的[[abundance|大量]]项目却挤在一个槽号。我能[[conceive|设想]]搬迁出错，但不能解释同一个纸袋去了两处。宴席用的[[napkin|餐巾]]上盖着捐赠章，一名[[reckless|鲁莽的]]服务人员说把章拿去仓库用就行。馆员听懂事情的[[magnitude|严重性]]，立即把章收回，带我们绕过装卸船的[[stern|船尾]]。她不再以为眼前只是馆藏争执。","库房的[[rotary|旋转的]]搬运台还在，基金曾[[dub|称]]它为‘新生平台’。录像旁白里夸它有[[masculine|男性的]]力量，却根本不[[conform|符合]]设备限制。司机把一箱[[pumpkin|南瓜]]先搬出去，才敢[[profess|承认]]货台超载。老陈用[[empirical|以经验为依据的]]磨痕确认台面曾旋转，站方的新[[outfit|全套装备]]却拍于事故之后。那次[[ongoing|持续的]]投诉，被宣传稿叫作害虫的[[massacre|大规模屠灭]]，遮掉了货台倾斜造成的破箱。我们请司机具体说损坏发生在哪里，不让夸张的词盖住一次真正的洒漏。","宴席的健康海报还讲[[cholesterol|胆固醇]]，我觉得这份安全感太[[symbolic|象征性的]]。观测[[module|组件]]的箱皮上有同样饭盒印记；风突然在门外[[howl|呼啸]]，登记[[booth|小亭]]里的纸飞了一地。若雨灌进旧库将有[[disastrous|灾难性的]]后果，馆员先暂停货签[[processing|处理]]。程雾保持[[sober|冷静的]]声音，让大家沿高侧退开，紧张却像[[infectious|有感染力的]]情绪扩散。经理要[[expel|赶走]]我们，何警官已联络的岛上执勤员到场，确认查看许可，让她把门留着。纸签终于不用在追赶之中辨认。","站长仍强调平台的[[superiority|优越]]，说地理[[latitude|纬度]]不同，保养也应不同。馆员带我们过一块[[cute|可爱的]]鸟类展板，打开展厅[[partition|隔墙]]后的柜。那里只是[[nominal|名义上的]]展品库，里面存着蓝线标签。她说这不算[[rebellion|反叛]]，只是不想旧纸被雨[[swamp|淹没]]。她愿意[[dedicate|把时间用于]]查清批次，老库收货路线原来自对岸[[peninsula|半岛]]。我们看到L074-6的标签背面写有白塔封样室，但原批次页已经领走，领用签字并非馆员。她把签字人的工号抄给执勤员，不替陌生人解释动机。","程雾在窗下将工号与工具清点照对齐，那是维修员已离职的同班工人。站长昨晚说没人能辨认旧货，其实一直掌握领用人。执勤员让我们先离开低库，馆员将标签底册按页封存，承诺提供移交轨迹。雨从两处屋缝落下，老陈用空盆接着，不让水溅到桌上。我们回塔前给维修员打电话，请他联系旧同事，别自己去风里的船岸找人。他沉默半分钟，说那人还住在岛上，只是怕被认作弄破货箱的唯一责任者。明天我们得先让他知道，查原表并不是为了只留下一个最方便指认的人。"],"en":["The curator joked she was an old-paper [[addict|addict]], but could not [[withhold|withhold]] donations freely. A fund [[banquet|banquet]] attracted visitors with the [[thrill|thrill]] of new displays. The director would [[convene|convene]] staff to sign a [[supplementary|supplementary]] manifest. A blue [[streak|streak]] on the bag must [[originate|originate]] on an old box. A donor [[millionaire|millionaire]] asked about [[transit|transit]] while an [[adolescent|adolescent]] volunteer cleared plates. [[nonetheless|Nonetheless]], she offered the old cabinets: she wanted to know why her signature appeared on another store's forms.","She noted the [[differentiation|differentiation]] between exhibits and samples. A [[cocaine|cocaine]] medicine-history text was reproduction commentary, not actual contents. Each shelf [[groove|groove]] had a number; an [[abundance|abundance]] of entries occupied one. I could [[conceive|conceive]] a relocation error, not simultaneous locations. A [[napkin|napkin]] bore the donation stamp. A [[reckless|reckless]] server suggested lending it to stores. Understanding the [[magnitude|magnitude]], she retrieved it and led us past a cargo boat's [[stern|stern]]. This exceeded a dispute about museum ownership.","A [[rotary|rotary]] cargo platform remained, once [[dub|dubbed]] a 'renewal platform'. Narration praised its [[masculine|masculine]] power but did not [[conform|conform]] to restrictions. Moving [[pumpkin|pumpkin]] crates, a driver dared [[profess|profess]] overload. Chen obtained [[empirical|empirical]] confirmation from wear. Photographs of new [[outfit|outfit]] postdated the incident. An [[ongoing|ongoing]] complaint became a pest [[massacre|massacre]] in publicity, concealing boxes broken by a tilting platform. We asked precisely where damage occurred, stripping extravagant language away from a real spill.","A [[cholesterol|cholesterol]] health poster made reassurance seem merely [[symbolic|symbolic]]. An observation [[module|module]] box bore matching lunch-container marks. Wind began to [[howl|howl]]; forms scattered from a [[booth|booth]]. Rain entering the store could be [[disastrous|disastrous]]. The curator suspended label [[processing|processing]]. In a [[sober|sober]] voice Cheng directed people uphill as [[infectious|infectious]] anxiety spread. A manager tried to [[expel|expel]] us. An island officer contacted by He confirmed permission and kept the door open, allowing papers to be read without pursuit.","The director stressed equipment [[superiority|superiority]] and different maintenance at this [[latitude|latitude]]. Passing a [[cute|cute]] bird display, the curator opened a cabinet behind a [[partition|partition]]. This [[nominal|nominal]] exhibition store contained blue-line labels. She called preservation no [[rebellion|rebellion]]: she would not let rain [[swamp|swamp]] old paper. Willing to [[dedicate|dedicate]] time to the inquiry, she showed a delivery route from the mainland [[peninsula|peninsula]]. L074-6's reverse named White Tower's sample room. Someone else had withdrawn the original table. She recorded his staff number without guessing his motives.","Cheng matched the number to a former colleague in tool photographs. The director had known a label recipient despite claiming nobody remembered old goods. We left the low store while the curator sealed the label register and promised custody details. Chen caught roof leaks in basins. We asked the maintenance worker to contact his colleague, not search windy shores alone. After a silence, he said the man remained on the island, afraid of being singled out for broken boxes. Tomorrow we needed to show him that tracing originals meant more than finding one convenient culprit."]});
